# Juggler

Read [attacks/juggler/AGENT.md](attacks/juggler/AGENT.md) before
substantial work. Look up the branch in
[attacks/juggler/index.json](attacks/juggler/index.json). Do not
restate the state of the problem here.

- Imports are `research.juggler_sequence` and `Problems.Juggler`.
  File path equals import path. Paths come from
  `research.juggler_sequence.lean_paths` (`REPO_ROOT`, `DATA_ROOT`,
  `DOCS_RESEARCH`, `BRANCHES_ROOT`, `FORMAL_DIR`).
- New Lean module → barrel, `LAYERS` (and `PAPER_MODULES` if Paper A),
  no `sorry` / `admit` / `axiom` even in comments, `lake env lean` first.
- New probe → `foo.py`, `test_foo.py`, `docs/problems/juggler_foo.md`
  with `PROMOTE | PARK | CLOSE`, ledger if named, rebuild the index,
  CLOSE/REFUTED into `docs/negative_knowledge.md`.
- Search [docs/negative_knowledge.md](docs/negative_knowledge.md)
  before reopening. Do not raise \(N_0\). Do not wrap a nested-floor
  bound as a Juggler construction. Finite checks are not a halt theorem.
